---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Research
description: "Research and long-form applied work by Florian Zeba, including Cortex: A Fixed-Point Theory of Governed Coding Agents, co-authored with Marius-Constantin Dinu."
permalink: /research/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<section class="border-b border-rule py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="u-shell u-manuscript">
    <p class="u-eyebrow lg:pt-2">Research</p>
    <div>
      <h1 class="u-display max-w-3xl text-section">One question, asked at two different scales.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-[1.02rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">{{ research.statement }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# -------------------------------------------------------------- Papers -- #}
<section class="border-b border-rule py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="u-shell u-manuscript">
    <p class="u-eyebrow lg:pt-1.5">Papers</p>
    <div>
      <ul class="space-y-px">
        {% for p in research.papers %}
          {% include "partials/paper-card.njk" %}
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <p class="u-meta mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        The PDF is hosted by my co-author on dinu.at and linked rather than mirrored here.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ------------------------------------------------------------- Applied -- #}
<section class="border-b border-rule bg-surface-2/40 py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="u-shell u-manuscript">
    <p class="u-eyebrow lg:pt-1.5">Applied</p>
    <div>
      <h2 class="u-display mb-3 max-w-2xl text-section">Long-form work published here.</h2>
      <p class="mb-8 max-w-2xl text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
        Investigations that ran long enough to need sources. Written solo, and distinct from
        the co-authored papers above.
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-px">
        {% for a in research.applied %}
          <li class="group border border-rule transition-colors hover:border-ink/25">
            <a href="/posts/{{ a.post }}/" class="block p-6 sm:p-7">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
                <h3 class="u-display text-[1.35rem] text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-ultra">{{ a.title }}</h3>
                <span class="u-meta">{{ a.year }}</span>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">{{ a.note }}</p>
              <span class="u-link mt-4 inline-block font-mono text-[0.74rem] uppercase tracking-[0.09em]">Read it →</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ----------------------------------------------------------- Talks -- #}
{# The whole section is gated, not just its contents: an empty Talks heading
   reads as a gap, and the placeholder that used to sit here was build-time
   scaffolding that was shipping to the live page. Add entries to
   research.talks in src/_data/research.js and the section returns. #}
{% if research.talks.length %}
<section class="border-b border-rule py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="u-shell u-manuscript">
    <p class="u-eyebrow lg:pt-1.5">Talks</p>
    <div>
      <ul class="divide-y divide-rule border-y border-rule">
        {% for t in research.talks %}
          <li class="grid gap-x-8 gap-y-1 py-4 lg:grid-cols-[10rem_minmax(0,1fr)]">
            <span class="u-meta">{{ t.date }}</span>
            <span>
              <span class="block text-[0.98rem] text-ink">{{ t.title }}</span>
              <span class="u-meta">{{ t.event }}</span>
            </span>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="border-b border-rule bg-ink py-16 text-surface sm:py-20">
  <div class="u-shell">
    <p class="u-eyebrow !text-surface/45">Get in touch</p>
    <h2 class="u-display mt-4 max-w-3xl text-[clamp(1.7rem,4vw,2.9rem)]">Working on something adjacent?</h2>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3">
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.author.email }}" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 border border-surface bg-surface px-5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[0.76rem] uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-ink transition-opacity hover:opacity-85">{{ site.author.email }}</a>
      <a href="/posts/" class="inline-block py-1 font-mono text-[0.78rem] text-surface/75 underline decoration-surface/30 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-surface">All writing →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
